  <Misc>
    <Accuracy>
    Parameter set tested in combination for all O, N, C, H interactions.
    Reaction energies show errors of about 5 kcal, although parameters
    have overbinding of 5-10 kcal. Geometries have an accuracy of 0.014 A in bond
    lengths and of  about 2 degree in bond angles. Vibrational frequencies show mean errors
    of 5-7 % , although several modes show larger errors (e.g. C-C stretching modes).
    </Accuracy>
    <Failures></Failures>
    <Publications>
      <Fit>Elstner M. Dissertation an der Universitaet Paderborn
      </Fit>
      <Other id="1" >
       M. Elstner et al., Phys. Rev. B  58 (1998) 7260.
      </Other> 
    </Publications>
    <Notes>
      Erep shifted in order to reproduce small errors in reaction energies.
      Cutoff chosen in order to be smaller than second neighbor distance in typical
      organic molecules (see Dissertation).
    </Notes>
  </Misc>
</Documentation>

